Velero Headlamp plugin

The schedule expression helpers in src/cron.ts and their tests in src/cron.test.ts
are adapted from the Headlamp project's Velero plugin:
https://github.com/headlamp-k8s/plugins/tree/main/velero
Copyright The Headlamp Authors, licensed under Apache License 2.0.

This implementation follows the upstream plugin's Kubernetes custom resource
and sidebar patterns, and adds write operations, artifact inspection, comparison,
recovery and a Kubernetes service proxy artifact reader.
